    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Name of This Band Is Talking Heads is a double live album by Talking Heads, originally released in 1982. The first disc featured the original quartet in recordings from 1977 and 1979, and the second disc the expanded ten-piece lineup that toured in 1980 and 1981. The album contains live versions of songs that appear on their first four studio albums, \"\", \"More Songs About Buildings and Food\", \"Fear of Music\", and \"Remain in Light.\" The cassette edition of the album included \"Cities\" as a bonus track not included on the vinyl edition – this track has been included on the subsequent CD release.",
      "depth": 0,
